usage: main.py [-h] [--config CONFIG] [--source SOURCE]
               [--replay {realtime,sync}] [--show] [--no-plates]
               [--no-publisher]

Garage vision service (S1)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG
  --source SOURCE       video file or rtsp:// URL (overrides config)
  --replay {realtime,sync}
                        file replay mode
  --show                show debug window (SPACE starts/pauses/resumes; Q
                        quits)
  --no-plates           disable plate reading (speed test)
  --no-publisher        disable Service 2 publishing for local video testing
